srow(343, 3, 'MATERIAL', f'AND THE EIGHTEEN BENEDICTIONS THE FIRST PROPHETS ORDAINED FOR ISRAEL TO PRAY EVERY DAY DO NOT OPEN WITH ISRAEL\'S NEED BUT WITH THE PLACE\'S PRAISE — "THE GREAT, MIGHTY AND AWESOME GOD", "YOU ARE HOLY AND YOUR NAME IS AWESOME" — THEN "WHO LOOSES THE BOUND", "WHO HEALS THE SICK", AND AT THE END "WE GIVE THANKS TO YOU". ({SP_(343, 3, "ואף", "שמונה", "עשרה", "ברכות", "שתקנו", "נביאים", "הראשונים")} "and also the eighteen benedictions the first prophets ordained"): THE DAILY PRAYER\'S ORDER TAUGHT FROM THE BLESSING — the eighteen a shelf datum (Berakhot 4:3 the answer sheet\'s row, cited — the compile\'s case), praise, petition, thanks; the row cites no verse of the chapter (one of the seven the dump lists), read whole all the same. The compile: the liturgy\'s law a status the compile holds as a parameter (the prayer\'s three parts). DV33-01. Fresh.')
